    <item>
      <title>Maple&amp;#039;s Pic - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACWW Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/25/maples-pic/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/25/maples-pic/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 03:55:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-9035" class="post-9035 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Maple&amp;#8217;s Pic&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	 	 	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Yesterday, Maple pinged me and told me I&amp;#8217;m the best friend she has in Forest. Aww. 😊 But the best part is that she then gave me her photo!!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-bff.jpg" alt="Maple: You're the best friend I've got here in Forest, so I want to give you this." class="wp-image-9036" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I took her picture home and put it on display, moving Truffles&amp;#8217;s pic to storage. 😛&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-pic.jpg" alt="Maple's pic on display in my room of Gulliver items." class="wp-image-9037" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt; Maple&amp;#8217;s favorite quote is on the back: &amp;#8220;Maple + Moppina = BFF!&amp;#8221;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-quote.jpg" alt="Quote on Maple's pic: Maple + Moppina = BFF!" class="wp-image-9038" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;I thought&lt;em&gt; I&lt;/em&gt; was your best friend.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Of course, Moppina is a reference to a villager conversation that I first saw in &lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2018/10/30/moppina/"&gt;2018&lt;/a&gt;. Margie said that her mop&amp;#8217;s name is Moppina, and &amp;#8220;she&amp;#8221; is her best friend. (Other normal personality villagers can say the same thing.) It&amp;#8217;s an obscure reference to include on a villager&amp;#8217;s photo, but I appreciate details like that. 🙂&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I played again tonight, and it was raining in town. Chief told me that a while back, someone threw a wallet away near where we were standing.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chief-wallet.jpg" alt="Chief: A while back, someone threw a wallet away around here." class="wp-image-9039" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He said it was dirty and there was grease caked onto it, so that&amp;#8217;s why it was discarded.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/chief-grease.jpg" alt="Chief: It had dirty grease caked onto it, so that's why it got pitched, sparkles." class="wp-image-9040" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But he said that was no excuse for wasting the wallet. I don&amp;#8217;t know, it probably smelled pretty bad if was caked in grease. They just shouldn&amp;#8217;t have discarded it on the ground. At least take it to the recycle bin!&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Pippy asked me to deliver a letter to Derwin, and she warned me not to read it. But Derwin clearly didn&amp;#8217;t feel the same way, because he gladly showed it to me. 😛&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/derwin-pippy-letter.jpg" alt="Hi, Derwin! Derwin! How's it shaking with you today? A glasses case is now mine! It rocks! -Pippy" class="wp-image-9041" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I returned to Pippy, she rewarded me with a stool.&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0ff365ea4b4ae589e18c26b092fe26946a6e14116b63065f41029c8c6138c7c8?s=98&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g' class='avatar avatar-49 photo' height='49' width='49'/&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/25/maples-pic/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-25T23:55:00-04:00"&gt;September 25, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-26T00:36:50-04:00"&gt;September 26, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt; &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-bff.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>House Swap? - Jeff&amp;#039;s New Leaf Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/09/21/house-swap/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/09/21/house-swap/</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 02:58:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-18749" class="post-18749 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;House Swap?&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Last night, Mira asked me to bring her a piece of fresh fruit.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260920_HNI_0081.jpg" alt="Mira: Awesome! You're the greatest! I'll be waiting! At Nook's!" class="wp-image-18750" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I gave her a perfect peach, and she rewarded me with an office desk. Outside of the context of Animal Crossing, the idea of trading a piece of fruit for an office desk sounds so ridiculous. 😆&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Over at the campsite, Phoebe the &lt;s&gt;phoenix&lt;/s&gt; ostrich was camping. Her outfit was fire, and she seems pretty cool. But of course, my town is full.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260920_HNI_0086.jpg" alt="Phoebe: I'm Phoebe! And you're... Jeff? Nice to meet you!" class="wp-image-18751" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;With some help from my monthly bank account interest, my savings balance has reached 140 million bells.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260920_HNI_0089.jpg" alt="Your current balance is 140,000,000 bells." class="wp-image-18752" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I played again tonight, and Rolf wanted to play a game of hide-and-seek. He said it&amp;#8217;s an intellectual game where we try to read each other&amp;#8217;s minds. I&amp;#8217;m not quite sure that&amp;#8217;s an accurate description, but sure, I&amp;#8217;ll play!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0091.jpg" alt="Rolf: It's a very intellectual game where the it and those hiding try to read each other's minds!" class="wp-image-18753" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He gave me ten minutes to find him, Jeremiah, and Hornsby. Within two minutes, I had found two of them, but the interesting part is where they hid. Jeremiah was hiding behind Rolf&amp;#8217;s house&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0093.jpg" alt="Jeremiah: No! How'd you find me?! I was in super-stealth mode and everything!" class="wp-image-18754" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;And then Rolf returned the favor, hiding behind Jeremiah&amp;#8217;s house! It&amp;#8217;s like they swapped houses for the game! 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0094.jpg" alt="Rolf tries to hide behind Jeremiah's house." class="wp-image-18755" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I later found Hornsby behind a tree near the Roost to secure my victory.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0096.jpg" alt="Rolf: So it looks like the winner of this game is muscles!" class="wp-image-18756" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Rolf gave me my prize: A new TV with VCR. What, was a rotary phone not available? 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0097.jpg" alt="Rolf: Here. My TV with VCR is your reward! A good reward is the best way to remember victory!" class="wp-image-18757" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;In that case, I&amp;#8217;ve already forgotten it.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I walked up to the city, several of my former villagers were hanging out near the entrance. That included Daisy, Bob, Julian, and Lily. 😊&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="240" src="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260921_HNI_0004.jpg" alt="Daisy: I love how alive this part of town is!" class="wp-image-18758" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2026/09/21/house-swap/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-21T22:58:15-04:00"&gt;September 21, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-21T22:58:16-04:00"&gt;September 21, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260920_HNI_0081.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Crazy Outdoor Types - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACCF Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/19/crazy-outdoor-types/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/19/crazy-outdoor-types/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 03:52:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-14175" class="post-14175 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Crazy Outdoor Types&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;The September Bug-Off (the final one of the year) was held today. Unfortunately, I played too late in the day to participate. But Nat was kind enough to tell me that Apollo was the event&amp;#8217;s big winner. He used his eagle eyes to catch a 61-point walkingstick. Congrats, Apollo!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8647-sm.jpg" alt="Nat: The 61-point walkingstick caught by Apollo from right here in Forest." class="wp-image-14176" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I visited Big Top&amp;#8217;s house, I was surprised to see how many fish he had in his house! That included a big&amp;#8230;arapaima? I certainly didn&amp;#8217;t catch that for him as a favor, but he must&amp;#8217;ve bought it from me over the summer. (They do sometimes offer more than Tom Nook for your catches.)&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8648-sm.jpg" alt="Big Top's house full of fish." class="wp-image-14177" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I ran into Bluebear outside, she said she was wearing &amp;#8220;fishing fashion&amp;#8221; even though she doesn&amp;#8217;t have a fishing rod. She said she can handle fishing, but she&amp;#8217;s not going to become of those &amp;#8220;crazy outdoor types.&amp;#8221; I don&amp;#8217;t think fishing makes you crazy, does it? 😛 &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8649-sm.jpg" alt="Bluebear: I can handle fishing, but I'm not about to become one of those crazy outdoor types!" class="wp-image-14178" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;You&amp;#8217;re a bear.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;It was an odd conversation, if you ask me.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Felicity asked me to deliver an extinguisher to Scoot, and she then rewarded me with 520 bells. I&amp;#8217;m not sure why Scoot needed an extinguisher, but I hope his house isn&amp;#8217;t on fire! 😛&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I went up to the Roost to catch K.K. Slider&amp;#8217;s Saturday night show. I asked him for a random song, and he performed &amp;#8220;Go K.K. Rider!&amp;#8221; for me. Good song!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8650-sm.jpg" alt="K.K.: All right, get ready to dig the riffs on this ditty: Go K.K. Rider!." class="wp-image-14179" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I worked my way back around to town hall, I found a fossil in the recycle bin! It was an icthyo torso (not to be confused with an itchy torso). I&amp;#8217;m always hoping to find good stuff in the recycling, so it&amp;#8217;s nice to occasionally scratch that itch. 😉&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Enjoy your weekend, and I&amp;#8217;ll be back with another entry next week!&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/19/crazy-outdoor-types/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-19T23:52:00-04:00"&gt;September 19, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-20T01:24:11-04:00"&gt;September 20, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8647-sm.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Underground Lights - Jeff&amp;#039;s New Horizons Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/09/19/underground-lights/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/09/19/underground-lights/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 03:33:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-9694" class="post-9694 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Underground Lights&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;While digging up a fossil next to Louie&amp;#8217;s house on Monday, Louie&amp;#8217;s house temporarily disappears (as it does when you get too close). But what was interesting is that you could see two lights shining on the ground, under his house!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="677" height="390" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/louie-lights.jpg" alt="Lights shine on the ground under Louie's house." class="wp-image-9695" sizes="(max-width: 677px) 100vw, 677px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Are there some glow worms under his house? 😉 Or perhaps an active volcano that&amp;#8217;s about to erupt? 🌋 A gate to Rizzo&amp;#8217;s realm of eternal extermination? 😆&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Vesta the sheep was camping at the campsite on Wednesday. She said she felt like she belonged here in Forest&amp;#8230;but I didn&amp;#8217;t agree.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vesta-camper-sm.jpg" alt="Vesta: Do you think that could be true?" class="wp-image-9696" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Ewe must be kidding.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;The super cute Lolly was in town as a tourist again, so I just had to talk to her. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/lolly-tourist-sm.jpg" alt="Lolly: Hey, you're a local I met before, aren't you?" class="wp-image-9698" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I&amp;#8217;ve had her in my New Leaf town since &lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/newleafblog/2018/09/01/ultimate-camper/"&gt;2018&lt;/a&gt;! It would be hard to ever let her go&amp;#8230;unless I got her in New Horizons too. (It&amp;#8217;s easier to let someone go if I have them in another game.) Maybe someday.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Tonight, I headed over to the plaza for K.K. Slider&amp;#8217;s Saturday night performance. Why does it seem like K.K. is the only character who ever asks how we&amp;#8217;re feeling?&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="700" height="394" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/kk-mood-sm.jpg" alt="K.K.: Let's hear it. What's the mood over in Jeffville?" class="wp-image-9697" sizes="auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;He played &amp;#8220;K.K. Western&amp;#8221; for me, Peanut, and Merengue.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Here are a few other quick notes about this week in Forest:&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;ul class="wp-block-list"&gt; &lt;li&gt;On Tuesday, I caught an olive flounder for Bob. He rewarded me with a cowboy shirt. 🤠&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;I recovered Wisp&amp;#8217;s spirits for him, and he thanked me by giving me some shower sandals.&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;I also helped out Gullivarrr, and he sent me a pirate beard in the mail.&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;Yesterday, I returned a lost book to Merengue and she gave me a doctor&amp;#8217;s coat.&lt;/li&gt;    &lt;li&gt;I crafted some medicine for a sick Bones tonight, and he thanked me with a soccer-uniform top.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/2026/09/19/underground-lights/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-19T23:33:00-04:00"&gt;September 19, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-20T00:28:00-04:00"&gt;September 20, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acnhblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/louie-lights.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Whitney&amp;#039;s Birthday - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACWW Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/18/whitneys-birthday/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/18/whitneys-birthday/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 03:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-9017" class="post-9017 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Whitney&amp;#8217;s Birthday&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	 	 	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Yesterday, I received a letter from Wishy in the mail. It was about the shooting star I wished on last week. He &amp;#8220;granted my wish&amp;#8221; by sending me a dracaena. I&amp;#8217;m not sure that&amp;#8217;s quite what I wished for, but a free gift is a free gift.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Pippy was talking about the Bug-Off that&amp;#8217;s coming up on Sunday. She told me she has a bite-proof dress that (somehow?) keeps the bugs from biting her.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pippy-bite.jpg" alt="Pippy: I got this cute bite-proof dress to keep the bugs from taking revenge on me." class="wp-image-9018" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Tell me your secret. Mosquitos keep biting me!&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Maple was finally over her cold that she&amp;#8217;s had for the past couple weeks. She thanked me for the medicine by giving me a watermelon table. &lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/maple-miserable.jpg" alt="Maple: If it weren't you for, I'd still be curled up in bed, feeling miserable!" class="wp-image-9019" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;I&amp;#8217;m glad you&amp;#8217;re not feeling melon-choly now!&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;When I visited Whitney, I found a pack of wolves inside her house. 😉 It was her birthday, and she was celebrating with Chief.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/whitney-bday.jpg" alt="Whitney: Well, well, look who it is. Welcome to Whitney's Birthday Bash, fribbit!" class="wp-image-9020" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;For a gift, I gave her the Nintendo bench that I bought from Pippy on the last &lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/05/better-call-sell/"&gt;Flea Market day&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/whitney-bench.jpg" alt="Whitney: Oh, look at this! It's just what I've always wanted! A Nintendo bench." class="wp-image-9021" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I played again tonight, and Derwin told me one of his darkest secrets: He likes clothes with fringes! 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/derwin-fringes.jpg" alt="Derwin: It's one of my darkest secrets, but...I'm actually into clothes with fringes." class="wp-image-9022" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Whitney wanted to have a competition to see who could catch a bell cricket first, and I actually agreed to the battle. Whitney assured me that she wouldn&amp;#8217;t lose to a loser like me. 🙄&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/whitney-loser.jpg" alt="Whitney: Tee hee! I'll never lose to a loser like you!" class="wp-image-9023" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;So I went around looking for crickets, and there were plenty of them. Unfortunately, the vast majority were regular crickets, not bell crickets! After catching several of the wrong ones, I had to hunt by sound and listen for the different call of the bell crickets. It took me seven and a half minutes, but I finally caught one!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/bell-cricket.jpg" alt="I caught a bell cricket! He's the littlest musician!" class="wp-image-9024" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;By that point, I was afraid Whitney would&amp;#8217;ve already caught one. (Or at least &lt;em&gt;claimed&lt;/em&gt; to.) But fortunately, she didn&amp;#8217;t. I gave her the bug, and she handed over a parlor wall as my prize for winning. But she wasn&amp;#8217;t happy about losing to me. Too bad, wolf girl.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="400" height="299" src="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/whitney-thumbs.jpg" alt="Whitney: I lost to you?! Those opposable thumbs you have really help, huh?" class="wp-image-9025" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 85vw, 400px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Excuses, excuses.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;After selling the remaining crickets and mosquitos in my pockets, I went to town hall. There, I found a cabana lamp in the recycle bin.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Enjoy your weekend, everyone! I&amp;#8217;ll be back with another entry next week. 🙂&lt;/p&gt; 	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0ff365ea4b4ae589e18c26b092fe26946a6e14116b63065f41029c8c6138c7c8?s=98&amp;d=mm&amp;r=g' class='avatar avatar-49 photo' height='49' width='49'/&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/2026/09/18/whitneys-birthday/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-18T23:58:00-04:00"&gt;September 18, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-19T00:43:19-04:00"&gt;September 19, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt; &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/acwwblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/pippy-bite.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Missing Link? - Jeff&amp;#039;s ACCF Blog</title>
      <author>Jeff</author>
      <link>https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/12/missing-link/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/12/missing-link/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 03:58:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;article id="post-14166" class="post-14166 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized"&gt; 	 	&lt;header class="entry-header"&gt; 		&lt;h1 class="entry-title"&gt;Missing Link?&lt;/h1&gt;	&lt;/header&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-header --&gt;  	&lt;div class="entry-content"&gt; 		 &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Scoot was sick today&amp;#8230;maybe it was from eating all that &lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/08/22/mouthful-of-ash/" data-type="post" data-id="14132"&gt;ash&lt;/a&gt; during the fireworks festival. 😉 But I gave him some medicine, so hopefully he&amp;#8217;ll start feeling better soon.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;There was a new house in town, so I went inside to meet Iggly&amp;#8217;s replacement: It was Bluebear the&amp;#8230;blue bear. 😆&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img fetchpriority="high" width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8643-sm.jpg" alt="Bluebear: Oh! Hiya! I'm Bluebear! I'm gonna, like, take the world by STORM! Tee hee!" class="wp-image-14167" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I like her, and she&amp;#8217;s an improvement over Iggly. (Sorry, Iggly.) But it&amp;#8217;ll be nice to have her around. Welcome to Forest, Bluebear!&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Big Top recently asked me for a new catchphrase, and I told him to say &amp;#8220;it&amp;#8217;s Link.&amp;#8221; I guess I&amp;#8217;m a bit excited about the Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time remake coming out in November. 😛&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;But speaking of Big Top, he asked me to play a game of hide-and-seek this afternoon. He gave me ten minutes to find him, Apollo, and Pecan. My eagle eyes led me to Apollo almost instantly. He was trying to hide behind Willow&amp;#8217;s house.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8644-sm.jpg" alt="Apollo, during a game of hide-and-seek: Well, pickle and can me! It looks like I've been found." class="wp-image-14168" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;About a minute later, I found Big Top behind a tree near Nook &amp;#8216;n&amp;#8217; Go. He told me there was only one person left to find&amp;#8230;but his catchphrase fit in quite nicely.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="499" height="280" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/accf-hidden-link.jpg" alt="Big Top: There's only one of us left for you to find? Well, good luck, it's Link!" class="wp-image-14169" sizes="(max-width: 499px) 100vw, 499px" /&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;I&amp;#8217;ll have to find the missing Link! 😉&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;With 6+ minutes remaining on the game timer, I found Pecan next to Able Sisters. (It wasn&amp;#8217;t Link after all.) But I was surprised to see that Big Top had already shared his new catchphrase with her!&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8645-sm.jpg" alt="Pecan: OH NO! Can't you pretend you didn't see me, it's Link?" class="wp-image-14170" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;   &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;I won the game, and Big Top rewarded me with his mega dingloid.&lt;/p&gt;    &lt;p class="wp-block-paragraph"&gt;Shortly after that, I wrapped up my game for the afternoon. But I returned (briefly) tonight, mainly just to check out K.K. Slider&amp;#8217;s concert. I asked him for a random song, and he performed &amp;#8220;King K.K.&amp;#8221; for me.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div class="wp-block-image"&gt; &lt;figure class="aligncenter size-full"&gt;&lt;img width="500" height="268" src="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8646-sm.jpg" alt="K.K.: All right, get ready to dig the riffs on this ditty: King K.K.." class="wp-image-14171" sizes="auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /&gt;&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;/div&gt;	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-content --&gt;  	 	&lt;footer class="entry-footer"&gt; 		&lt;span class="posted-on"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Posted on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/2026/09/12/missing-link/" rel="bookmark"&gt;&lt;time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-09-12T23:58:00-04:00"&gt;September 12, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;time class="updated" datetime="2026-09-13T02:11:21-04:00"&gt;September 13, 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="byline"&gt;&lt;span class="screen-reader-text"&gt;Author &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="author vcard"&gt;&lt;a class="url fn n" href="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/author/jvgsjeff/"&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;			&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;!-- .entry-footer --&gt;  &lt;/article&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://www.jvgs.net/accfblog/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RUU_8643-sm.jpg" type="image/jpeg"/>
    </item>
